    {
      "decision": "autoplan-20261103023817-r2-d2",
      "title": "Critical: Futility look is one-sided: a skill trending to hurts stops at half the panel and is posted as not distinguished [autoplan-20261103023817-ceo-r2-native-1]",
      "chosen": "a",
      "text": "apply the fix to the plan: Stop for futility only when conditional power is under 10% for a true effect of both plus and minus the planned MDD, so a skill whose interim estimate favors none runs the full panel and can read hurts. Print the interim estimate, its 95% interval and its direction at every stop, and have R48 treat an interim estimate in none's favor as a loss lead, not a plain null. Add both cases to O5's keyless dry run.",
      "gate_rev": 2,
      "status": "incorporated",
      "at": "2026-11-03T16:05:59.492Z",
      "item": "d2",
      "phase": "ceo",
      "plan_sha256": "9ff6fb7a6baa6820279f73c74f80c30c892348350cbf98578f0a20111e71b283",
      "settled_at": "2026-11-03T16:27:03.263Z",
      "old_plan_sha256": "9ff6fb7a6baa6820279f73c74f80c30c892348350cbf98578f0a20111e71b283",
      "new_plan_sha256": "182918be9f1bcd9747d22786f117fe16426dd7960238e4acfa6e7fe58e8ab244"
    },
    {
      "decision": "autoplan-20261103023817-r2-d3",
      "title": "High: The 1.5x cost-per-solved guard can't be passed by most wave-1 told skills at the plan's own 2.2x to 5.0x multiples, and the plan doesn't say whether it binds [autoplan-20261103023817-ceo-r2-native-2]",
      "chosen": "a",
      "text": "apply the fix to the plan: State whether the guard binds told skills and in which form (#169 binds it on H-inv as an upper bound <= 1.5, README.md:178). Print each skill's break-even gain beside its MDD in section 8 (at a 50% control rate: plan-eng-review +23, plan-devex-review and plan-design-review +30, devex-review +33, design-review +50, autoplan unreachable). Define solved for U's and X's cost figure, reuse #169's G3 definition in O4, and write the R48 rule that turns the ratio interval into KEEP or CUT-CANDIDATE. Ask Garry before admission whether 1.5x on hidden-test solves is the bar for a told skill.",
      "gate_rev": 2,
      "status": "incorporated",
      "at": "2026-11-03T16:05:59.492Z",
      "item": "d3",
      "phase": "ceo",
      "plan_sha256": "9ff6fb7a6baa6820279f73c74f80c30c892348350cbf98578f0a20111e71b283",
