      "old_plan_sha256": "9ff6fb7a6baa6820279f73c74f80c30c892348350cbf98578f0a20111e71b283",
      "new_plan_sha256": "182918be9f1bcd9747d22786f117fe16426dd7960238e4acfa6e7fe58e8ab244"
    },
    {
      "decision": "autoplan-20261103023817-r2-d4",
      "title": "High: The promise that wave 1 settles GST-1218 rests on an unnamed after pin and on a null inference the plan disowns [autoplan-20261103023817-ceo-r2-native-3]",
      "chosen": "a",
      "text": "apply the fix to the plan: Replace 'A null rules out a gain of that size' with an interval rule: a gain is ruled out only above the upper 95% bound of told minus none, or against F2's break-even gain. Tie GST-1218's keep-or-cut reading to a told arm on the named after pin. If the pin isn't named by G admission, tell the Captain then that plan-eng-review's and plan-devex-review's rows can only inform GST-1218 (a forced-line verdict can't KEEP or CUT, line 27), and let the Captain choose between waiting and reading the forced line as information.",
      "gate_rev": 2,
      "status": "incorporated",
      "at": "2026-11-03T16:05:59.492Z",
      "item": "d4",
      "phase": "ceo",
      "plan_sha256": "9ff6fb7a6baa6820279f73c74f80c30c892348350cbf98578f0a20111e71b283",
      "settled_at": "2026-11-03T16:27:03.263Z",
      "old_plan_sha256": "9ff6fb7a6baa6820279f73c74f80c30c892348350cbf98578f0a20111e71b283",
      "new_plan_sha256": "182918be9f1bcd9747d22786f117fe16426dd7960238e4acfa6e7fe58e8ab244"
    },
    {
      "decision": "autoplan-20261103023817-r2-d5",
      "title": "High: Central prices sit at half the house's real-task central (R3 amendment 4: 5x Verified) and the price-risk case stresses only the none session [autoplan-20261103023817-ceo-r2-native-4]",
      "chosen": "a",
      "text": "apply the fix to the plan: Stress section 8 at the house central (5x Verified) and high (10x), with particle-1 at quick look 3's 0.41 of Opus, told multiples at 1.5x their central and the agent user at 2x, and print which rows survive and their MDDs. Show the wave-1 table's MDDs at both central and house central. Reuse R3 amendment 4's between-part projection check between admission, screening and confirmatory, so a stage that would push a skill's re-sized MDD past what can change its decision stops before it spends. Recheck particle-1's 2-point fit at admission's metered ratio before any particle-1 spend.",
      "gate_rev": 2,
      "status": "incorporated",
      "at": "2026-11-03T16:05:59.492Z",
      "item": "d5",
      "phase": "ceo",
      "plan_sha256": "9ff6fb7a6baa6820279f73c74f80c30c892348350cbf98578f0a20111e71b283",
