    {
      "decision": "autoplan-20261103023817-r2-d7",
      "title": "High: Per-skill plans assume both skills in a family pass admission; a lone survivor costs $1,986 to $2,376 at its planned size [autoplan-20261103023817-eng-r2-native-1]",
      "chosen": "a",
      "text": "apply the fix to the plan: Price the one-survivor branch per family in section 8. At planned sizes the survivor pays every unspent shared cost (bulk authoring, screening, the whole none arm, the prereg thread) and costs autoplan $1,986, plan-eng-review $2,272, plan-devex-review $2,357, devex-review $2,376, plan-design-review $2,319 and design-review $2,237. Freeze a re-size rule (drop the particle-1 row first, then trials, then tasks) and print the MDD it buys (about 15 to 17 in G and X, 18.6 to 19.2 in U), or stop the survivor when that MDD passes the bound in F4. Apply the same rule when one skill stops at the futility look.",
      "gate_rev": 2,
      "status": "incorporated",
      "at": "2026-11-03T16:05:59.492Z",
      "item": "d7",
      "phase": "eng",
      "plan_sha256": "9ff6fb7a6baa6820279f73c74f80c30c892348350cbf98578f0a20111e71b283",
      "settled_at": "2026-11-03T16:27:03.263Z",
      "old_plan_sha256": "9ff6fb7a6baa6820279f73c74f80c30c892348350cbf98578f0a20111e71b283",
      "new_plan_sha256": "182918be9f1bcd9747d22786f117fe16426dd7960238e4acfa6e7fe58e8ab244"
    },
    {
      "decision": "autoplan-20261103023817-r2-d8",
      "title": "High: Told prices come from sessions where the procedure mostly did not run, and the forced arm that decision 3 expects to run has no price [autoplan-20261103023817-eng-r2-native-2]",
      "chosen": "a",
      "text": "apply the fix to the plan: Add forced and told-exposed price rows to section 8. The only metered told session (R3a told /investigate, $0.424) had exposure 2 of 10, E0's $0.236 is a plain none session, and v2 deleted v1's forced row (told plus 15%, with panel v3's forced lines at 1.7 times told on plan units). Price the confirmatory on the arm that will run: forced at told x1.15 central and x1.5 as the risk case (planned designs $1,704 to $1,777 and $1,836 to $2,081, autoplan over its ceiling; re-sized G MDDs 14.4/15.0 and 16.2/15.6). Have admission meter exposed and unexposed told sessions separately, and freeze the pin at admission: a pin named after admission needs a new admission paid from the reserve.",
      "gate_rev": 2,
      "status": "incorporated",
      "at": "2026-11-03T16:05:59.492Z",
      "item": "d8",
      "phase": "eng",
