      "new_plan_sha256": "182918be9f1bcd9747d22786f117fe16426dd7960238e4acfa6e7fe58e8ab244"
    },
    {
      "decision": "autoplan-20261103023817-r2-d9",
      "title": "High: Authoring is priced at TS's paid author and audit spend; the crew thread that mined, built, checked and sealed the tasks cost about five times that and has no line [autoplan-20261103023817-eng-r2-native-3]",
      "chosen": "a",
      "text": "apply the fix to the plan: Add a crew line per valid task for mining, building, checking and sealing, measured on each family's thin-slice thread and re-sized at admission. TS spent $7.93 of author and auditor calls plus $1.78 of VM for 7 valid tasks while its thread used about 43,500 credits before its /ship tail (GEVA-173.md:16), about $6.20 a valid task. Wave 1 needs about 800 valid tasks (G 372, U 192, X 237). At a fifth of TS's rate the planned designs cost $1,761 to $1,912 and re-size to MDDs of G 14.4/15.0, U 15.6 and X 14.4; at TS's full rate G alone needs about $2,300, more than both G reserves. Also price two preregs per family (admission and confirmatory) inside the $70 line, not one.",
      "gate_rev": 2,
